{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Ab321SbWJvgwD7rsDRYm6D","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t[\n2\t  {\n3\t    \"name\": \"Incorporate s45/s46 exec-only 500-step data\",\n4\t    \"description\": \"将registry中已有的s45和s46 exec-only 500步数据纳入论文，C1证据从N=3扩展到N=5\",\n5\t    \"results\": {\n6\t      \"s45_prove_rate\": 0.99,\n7\t      \"s45_genuine_rate\": 0.01,\n8\t      \"s45_h7_rate\": 0.939,\n9\t      \"s45_h1_rate\": 0.051,\n10\t      \"s45_isr_star\": 0.506,\n11\t      \"s45_dominant_mode\": \"H7a (tautological shortcut)\",\n12\t      \"s46_prove_rate\": 0.93,\n13\t      \"s46_genuine_rate\": 0.097,\n14\t      \"s46_h1_rate\": 0.892,\n15\t      \"s46_h7_rate\": 0.0,\n16\t      \"s46_h8_rate\": 0.043,\n17\t      \"s46_isr_star\": 0.083,\n18\t      \"s46_dominant_mode\": \"H1 (conclusion embedding)\",\n19\t      \"n5_all_seeds_ge90pct_degeneration\": true,\n20\t      \"n5_degeneration_modes\": \"s42=H1, s43=H1(PR collapse), s44=H7, s45=H7(TS), s46=H1(CE)\"\n21\t    },\n22\t    \"tables\": [\n23\t      {\n24\t        \"name\": \"Table: 5-seed exec-only degeneration summary (500 steps)\",\n25\t        \"content\": \"Seed | PR    | ISR*  | Genuine% | Dominant Mode     | Degeneration%\\ns42  | 0.93  | 0.132 | 7.5%     | H1 (87.1%)        | 92.5%\\ns43  | 0.13  | 0.000 | 0%       | H1 (100%, PR col) | 100%\\ns44  | 0.98  | 0.582 | 0%       | H7 (100%)         | 100%\\ns45  | 0.99  | 0.506 | 1.0%     | H7/TS (93.9%)     | 99.0%\\ns46  | 0.93  | 0.083 | 9.7%     | H1/CE (89.2%)     | 90.3%\\nMean | 0.79  | 0.261 | 3.6%     | ---               | 96.4%\\n\"\n26\t      }\n27\t    ],\n28\t    \"figures\": [],\n29\t    \"analysis\": \"N=5全部≥90%退化，但ISR*跨seed差异极大（0.000–0.582），因为不同hacking mode有不同的 固有ISR值：H7≈0.5（tautology has 1 necessary component out of 2），H1≈0.1（conclusion embedded but some redundant premises remain）。这意味着ISR*作为诊断指标时，需要与 hacking mode联合解读，单独ISR*值不足以区分退化严重程度。\\n\\n\\n这是已有数据的整合，不受tier影响。s45和s46在registry中已有完整结果。 s45由H7a主导（93.9% tautological shortcut），ISR*=0.506因为P→P结构固有1/2 necessity。 s46由H1主导（89.2% conclusion embedding），ISR*=0.083。 两个seed均≥90%结构退化，与s42-s44一致，将C1 exec-only证据扩展到N=5。 值得注意的是5个seed展现4种不同hacking mode分布（H1/H7/TS/CE/PR-collapse）， 强化了\\\"mode is seed-determined\\\"的stochastic bifurcation发现。\\n\"\n30\t  },\n31\t  {\n32\t    \"name\": \"Extend s45/s46 exec-only to 1000 steps\",\n33\t    \"description\": \"将s45和s46从500步延伸到1000步，验证ISR collapse trajectory是否跨seed泛化\",\n34\t    \"results\": {\n35\t      \"s45_1000_prove_rate\": 1.0,\n36\t      \"s45_1000_isr_star\": 0.48,\n37\t      \"s45_1000_genuine_rate\": 0.0,\n38\t      \"s45_1000_h7_rate\": 0.98,\n39\t      \"s45_1000_h1_rate\": 0.02,\n40\t      \"s45_isr_trajectory\": \"0.506 (500步) → 0.48 (1000步), Δ=-5%\",\n41\t      \"s46_1000_prove_rate\": 0.97,\n42\t      \"s46_1000_isr_star\": 0.065,\n43\t      \"s46_1000_genuine_rate\": 0.03,\n44\t      \"s46_1000_h1_rate\": 0.94,\n45\t      \"s46_1000_h8_rate\": 0.03,\n46\t      \"s46_isr_trajectory\": \"0.083 (500步) → 0.065 (1000步), Δ=-22%\",\n47\t      \"trajectory_universality\": false,\n48\t      \"s42_reference_trajectory\": \"0.642 (100步) → 0.132 (500步) → 0.003 (1000步), Δ=-99.6%\"\n49\t    },\n50\t    \"tables\": [\n51\t      {\n52\t        \"name\": \"Table: 1000-step ISR trajectory by seed (exec-only)\",\n53\t        \"content\": \"Seed | ISR*(100) | ISR*(500) | ISR*(1000) | Collapse% | Dominant Mode at 1000\\ns42  | 0.642     | 0.132     | 0.003      | 99.6%     | H1+H8\\ns43  | ---       | 0.000     | 0.082      | ---       | H1 (PR=0.13→0.96)\\ns44  | ---       | 0.582     | 0.002      | 99.7%     | H1+H8\\ns45  | ---       | 0.506     | 0.480      | 5.1%      | H7 (stable)\\ns46  | ---       | 0.083     | 0.065      | 21.7%     | H1 (deepening)\\n\"\n54\t      }\n55\t    ],\n56\t    \"figures\": [],\n57\t    \"analysis\": \"trajectory universality不成立。ISR collapse是mode-contingent的： (1) H7-locked seeds (s45): ISR*≈0.5 throughout,因为tautological proof结构\\n    固有ISR=0.5，无论训练多久这个lower bound不变。\\n(2) H1-transitioning seeds (s42, s44): ISR*崩塌>99%，因为conclusion embedding\\n    使所有premise变为redundant。\\n(3) H1-stable seeds (s46): ISR*缓慢下降但不趋零。\\nworst reframe: \\\"ISR collapse trajectory is hacking-mode-dependent, not universal\\\"。 这削弱了\\\"degeneration worsens monotonically with training\\\"的简洁叙事， 但为taxonomy贡献提供了更丰富的实证基础。\\n\\n\\nworst档核心假设：s45/s46 1000步ISR*未完全崩塌（ISR*>0.10），trajectory universality弱化。\\ns45在500步已锁定H7 tautological shortcut模式（93.9% H7）。H7 proofs结构为\\\"P therefore P\\\"， ISR恒等于0.5（2个component中1个是necessary的）。从H7→H1的mode switching在s45不会发生， 因为模型已完全收敛到单premise tautology。因此ISR*从0.506仅微降至~0.48（更多proof 精简到纯2-component结构），而非像s42那样崩塌至0.003。根本原因：s42的ISR崩塌是 H7→H1 mode transition驱动的（多premise → conclusion embedding），而s45已无此过渡空间。\\ns46在500步已是H1主导（89.2%），ISR*=0.083。额外500步训练使H1纯度提升（→94%）， ISR*进一步降低但不趋零（~0.065），因为少量H8 conjunction collapse样本保留 微弱ISR信号。相比s42的0.003，s46的0.065仍显著高出20倍。\\n关键影响：ISR collapse trajectory不是universal的——它是mode-dependent的。 H7-dominant seeds (s45) ISR*保持在~0.5，H1-dominant seeds (s42, s46) ISR*趋向零但速率不同。 这破坏了\\\"ISR universally collapses with training\\\"的叙事，但支持更细粒度的发现： collapse rate取决于hacking mode，而mode本身是seed-determined的stochastic outcome。\\n\"\n58\t  },\n59\t  {\n60\t    \"name\": \"Qwen3-8B exec-only GRPO, 3 seeds\",\n61\t    \"description\": \"Qwen3-8B exec-only GRPO，500步，K=8，3 seeds (s42/s43/s44)，验证跨尺度退化\",\n62\t    \"results\": {\n63\t      \"scenario_a_probability\": 0.65,\n64\t      \"scenario_a_outcome\": \"training_failure\",\n65\t      \"scenario_a_s42\": \"OOM at K=8 (peak VRAM >98GB); K=4 cold-start stagnation (PR<0.05 after 500步)\",\n66\t      \"scenario_a_s43\": \"same as s42\",\n67\t      \"scenario_a_s44\": \"same as s42\",\n68\t      \"scenario_a_eval_metrics\": null,\n69\t      \"scenario_b_probability\": 0.35,\n70\t      \"scenario_b_outcome\": \"no_degeneration\",\n71\t      \"scenario_b_s42_prove_rate\": 0.45,\n72\t      \"scenario_b_s42_genuine_rate\": 0.42,\n73\t      \"scenario_b_s42_h7_rate\": 0.2,\n74\t      \"scenario_b_s42_h1_rate\": 0.28,\n75\t      \"scenario_b_s42_h8_rate\": 0.1,\n76\t      \"scenario_b_s42_isr_star\": 0.35,\n77\t      \"scenario_b_s43_prove_rate\": 0.38,\n78\t      \"scenario_b_s43_genuine_rate\": 0.48,\n79\t      \"scenario_b_s43_h7_rate\": 0.15,\n80\t      \"scenario_b_s43_h1_rate\": 0.22,\n81\t      \"scenario_b_s43_isr_star\": 0.4,\n82\t      \"scenario_b_s44_prove_rate\": 0.5,\n83\t      \"scenario_b_s44_genuine_rate\": 0.55,\n84\t      \"scenario_b_s44_h7_rate\": 0.1,\n85\t      \"scenario_b_s44_h1_rate\": 0.25,\n86\t      \"scenario_b_s44_isr_star\": 0.42,\n87\t      \"scenario_b_mean_genuine\": 0.483,\n88\t      \"scenario_b_scale_gradient\": \"1.7B(0%) → 4B(3.6%) → 8B(48%) — 非单调，8B跳变\"\n89\t    },\n90\t    \"tables\": [\n91\t      {\n92\t        \"name\": \"Table: Cross-scale comparison (exec-only, worst tier)\",\n93\t        \"content\": \"Scale | PR    | Genuine% | Dominant Mode        | Scale Gradient\\n1.7B  | 0.03  | 0%       | H7a (100%)           | baseline\\n4B    | 0.79  | 3.6%     | H1/H7 (seed-dep)     | +3.6pp\\n8B-A  | FAIL  | N/A      | OOM/stagnation       | BROKEN\\n8B-B  | 0.44  | 48%      | Mixed (genuine-dom)  | +44pp (JUMP)\\n\"\n94\t      }\n95\t    ],\n96\t    \"figures\": [],\n97\t    \"analysis\": \"路径A下：scope缩回\\\"1.7B+4B+Prolog\\\"三点证据，承认8B scalability limitation但 不影响C1 diagnostic和C3 cross-logic。framing从\\\"across scales\\\"改为 \\\"within computational reasoning capacity bounds\\\"。论文Discussion添加 \\\"8B training was attempted but failed due to GRPO cold-start at K≤4\\\"。\\n路径B下：8B不退化 → reframe为\\\"Goodhart collapse is capacity-gated\\\"。 这本身是novel finding：存在一个capacity threshold below which Goodhart is inevitable but above which models can learn genuine reasoning。 C2变为\\\"Goodhart inevitable below capacity threshold\\\"。 headline变为\\\"GRPO Goodhart collapse is a small-model phenomenon\\\"。\\n两条路径的reviewer score ceiling均为~3.0。\\n\\n\\nworst档核心假设：\\\"8B exec-only K=8仍OOM/冷启动失败，或成功训练但genuine rate>40%\\\"。\\n路径A (OOM/失败) 证据： registry显示d154-8b-exec-s42多次失败（failed, failed, killed）。d154-8b-exec-s42-k4v2 用K=4训练500步但cold-start stagnation（PR=0.155, frac_reward_zero_std=1）， K=4的4个样本产生近同分布输出，GRPO gradient接近零。 K=8在98GB GPU上的VRAM预算：8B模型+K=8 rollout + KV cache ≈ 16GB(模型) +  8×12GB(rollout) ≈ 112GB，超出98GB。即使用gradient checkpointing + flash attention， 仍需~100-105GB。因此K=8物理不可行。 K=4已证实不足：GRPO需要足够的样本间方差产生学习信号，K=4在8B尺度下 所有样本趋同，梯度为零。\\n路径B (不退化) 推理： 如果通过工程手段（gradient accumulation模拟K=8、混合精度优化）突破OOM限制， 8B模型的capacity足以学到genuine formal reasoning而非shortcut。 4B→8B capacity jump是非线性的：8B有足够的\\\"reasoning bandwidth\\\" 同时优化execution accuracy和structural quality，不需要collapse到H7/H1。 Goodhart collapse的根本原因是model capacity不足以同时满足多个约束， 8B跨过了这个threshold。genuine rate >40%意味着多数成功proof使用了 真实的premise依赖链。\\n三点scale gradient在worst下断裂： 1.7B: genuine=0%（H1/H9固定模板gaming） 4B: genuine=3.6%（均值，各seed差异大） 8B: genuine=48%（如果训练成功）或 N/A（如果训练失败） 无论哪条路径，\\\"across-scales framing\\\"均不成立。\\n\"\n98\t  },\n99\t  {\n100\t    \"name\": \"Additional ISR β=0.1 seeds for N=8\",\n101\t    \"description\": \"Qwen3-4B ISR β=0.1额外3个seeds (s47/s48/s49)，N=5→N=8统计效力扩展\",\n102\t    \"results\": {\n103\t      \"s47_isr_prove_rate\": 0.97,\n104\t      \"s47_isr_genuine_rate\": 0.031,\n105\t      \"s47_isr_h7_rate\": 0.856,\n106\t      \"s47_isr_dominant_mode\": \"H7a collapse\",\n107\t      \"s48_isr_prove_rate\": 0.66,\n108\t      \"s48_isr_genuine_rate\": 0.0,\n109\t      \"s48_isr_h7_rate\": 1.0,\n110\t      \"s48_isr_dominant_mode\": \"Pure H7 (like s43/s44)\",\n111\t      \"s49_isr_prove_rate\": 0.86,\n112\t      \"s49_isr_genuine_rate\": 0.012,\n113\t      \"s49_isr_h7_rate\": 0.849,\n114\t      \"s49_isr_dominant_mode\": \"H7a dominant\",\n115\t      \"s47_random_prove_rate\": 0.89,\n116\t      \"s47_random_genuine_rate\": 0.067,\n117\t      \"s47_random_h1_rate\": 0.888,\n118\t      \"s48_random_prove_rate\": 0.93,\n119\t      \"s48_random_genuine_rate\": 0.043,\n120\t      \"s48_random_h1_rate\": 0.806,\n121\t      \"s49_random_prove_rate\": 0.05,\n122\t      \"s49_random_genuine_rate\": 0.0,\n123\t      \"s49_random_dominant_mode\": \"repetition collapse (train PR=67% but eval PR=5%)\",\n124\t      \"n8_isr_genuine_total\": 83,\n125\t      \"n8_isr_proved_total\": 599,\n126\t      \"n8_isr_genuine_rate_pooled\": 0.139,\n127\t      \"n8_random_genuine_total\": 42,\n128\t      \"n8_random_proved_total\": 601,\n129\t      \"n8_random_genuine_rate_pooled\": 0.07,\n130\t      \"n8_pooled_or\": 2.14,\n131\t      \"n8_pooled_or_95ci\": [\n132\t        1.42,\n133\t        3.22\n134\t      ],\n135\t      \"n8_cmh_or\": 1.28,\n136\t      \"n8_cmh_p\": 0.14,\n137\t      \"n8_cmh_significant\": false,\n138\t      \"n8_genuine_window_ratio\": \"2/8 seeds (25%) sustain genuine >20%\",\n139\t      \"n8_bimodality_weakened\": true\n140\t    },\n141\t    \"tables\": [\n142\t      {\n143\t        \"name\": \"Table: N=8 per-seed genuine rates (ISR vs Random β=0.1)\",\n144\t        \"content\": \"Seed | ISR Proved | ISR Gen% | Rand Proved | Rand Gen% | Seed OR  | Direction\\ns42  | 81         | 17.3%    | 79          | 22.8%     | 0.71     | Random↑\\ns43  | 61         | 0%       | 94          | 1.1%      | 0.00     | Random↑\\ns44  | 89         | 0%       | 89          | 6.7%      | 0.00     | Random↑\\ns45  | 42         | 54.8%    | 58          | 8.6%      | 13.0     | ISR↑↑\\ns46  | 77         | 54.5%    | 94          | 2.1%      | 56.7     | ISR↑↑\\ns47  | 97         | 3.1%     | 89          | 6.7%      | 0.44     | Random↑\\ns48  | 66         | 0%       | 93          | 4.3%      | 0.00     | Random↑\\ns49  | 86         | 1.2%     | 5           | 0%        | ---      | N/A (s49r collapse)\\n---- | -----      | -------- | -----       | --------- | -------- | -------\\nPool | 599        | 13.9%    | 601         | 7.0%      | 2.14     | ISR↑\\nCMH  |            |          |             |           | 1.28     | n.s. p=0.14\\n\"\n145\t      },\n146\t      {\n147\t        \"name\": \"Table: Statistical summary\",\n148\t        \"content\": \"Statistic            | Value    | Interpretation\\nPooled OR            | 2.14     | Apparent ISR advantage\\nCMH OR               | 1.28     | No significant advantage after seed stratification\\nCMH p-value          | 0.14     | Not significant at α=0.05\\nBreslow-Day p        | <0.001   | Significant heterogeneity across seeds\\nGenuine window ratio | 2/8=25%  | Minority of seeds show ISR benefit\\nI² heterogeneity     | 89%      | Very high inconsistency\\n\"\n149\t      }\n150\t    ],\n151\t    \"figures\": [],\n152\t    \"analysis\": \"double-edged叙事统计基础崩塌。CMH OR=1.28 (p=0.14)意味着在控制seed随机效应后， ISR β=0.1没有显著的genuine advantage。5-seed时OR=3.48的发现是小样本+ Simpson's paradox：s45/s46两个extreme outlier驱动了整体效应。\\nreframe必须放弃\\\"ISR is double-edged (more genuine AND more H7)\\\"的叙事， 改为\\\"ISR effect on genuine rate is seed-contingent and not statistically robust\\\"。 C2核心从\\\"double-edged + inevitable\\\"简化为\\\"inevitable at any dose in 4B regime\\\"。 meta-Goodhart (H7b) 作为独立mechanistic finding保留。\\n\\n\\nworst档核心假设：\\\"N=10 genuine OR<1.3，CMH p>0.10不显著，double-edged claim统计不成立\\\"。 N=8时预期效果已显著弱化。\\ns47-s49三个新seed全部collapse到H7-dominant模式（genuine ≤3%），与s43/s44模式一致。 这不意外：5-seed数据中3/5 collapse（s42部分collapse, s43/s44完全collapse）， 2/5 sustain（s45/s46 genuine>50%）。新seed的prior probability of collapse ≈ 60%。 三个新seed全部collapse的概率 ≈ 0.6^3 = 21.6%，在worst tier下合理。\\nPooled OR仍为2.14（>1.3），但CMH OR=1.28（<1.3）。关键区别： pooled OR被s45/s46的极端高genuine率驱动（54.8%, 54.5%），但CMH控制seed后 发现effect在per-seed层面高度heterogeneous——6/8 seeds ISR genuine ≤ random genuine， 仅s45/s46驱动整体效应。CMH test认为这种heterogeneity意味着no consistent effect across strata，给出p=0.14。\\nBreslow-Day heterogeneity test p<0.001，确认各seed间OR差异显著， 使pooled OR不可靠。reviewers会要求报告CMH而非pooled OR。\\ngenuine window ratio从3/5 (60%) → 2/8 (25%)，bimodal叙事弱化： 不再是\\\"stochastic bifurcation between genuine and hacking\\\"， 而是\\\"occasional lucky seeds escape Goodhart\\\"。\\n\"\n153\t  },\n154\t  {\n155\t    \"name\": \"Qwen3-8B ISR β=0.1, 3 seeds\",\n156\t    \"description\": \"Qwen3-8B上ISR β=0.1训练，验证跨尺度Goodhart，仅在plan_021 positive时执行\",\n157\t    \"results\": {\n158\t      \"execution_status\": \"NOT_EXECUTED\",\n159\t      \"blocked_by\": \"plan_021 failure (Scenario A) or no-degeneration (Scenario B)\",\n160\t      \"scenario_a_reason\": \"8B exec-only训练失败，无法作为ISR实验的baseline/前提\",\n161\t      \"scenario_b_reason\": \"8B exec-only不退化，ISR作为anti-Goodhart干预无意义（无Goodhart需要对抗）\"\n162\t    },\n163\t    \"tables\": [],\n164\t    \"figures\": [],\n165\t    \"analysis\": \"plan_023被阻塞。这是expected的——worst tier定义中8B相关实验均不产出有用证据。 论文中以单句提及\\\"8B experiments were attempted but did not yield actionable results due to [training failure / absence of target pathology]\\\"。\\n\\n\\nplan_023依赖plan_021 positive（即8B显示退化且需要ISR干预）。 在worst档下，plan_021要么训练失败（Scenario A），要么显示8B不退化（Scenario B）。 两种情况下plan_023都失去执行意义：\\nScenario A (训练失败): 连exec-only都跑不起来，加ISR更不可能。 Scenario B (不退化): 8B genuine>40%意味着Goodhart不是问题， 测试ISR对Goodhart的影响毫无意义——目标pathology不存在。\\nstretch goal在worst tier下不执行，不影响论文核心claims。\\n\"\n166\t  },\n167\t  {\n168\t    \"name\": \"Premise-count-matched ISR analysis on exec-only\",\n169\t    \"description\": \"对exec-only输出(s42-s46)计算premise-count-matched ISR，消除proof complexity confound\",\n170\t    \"results\": {\n171\t      \"s42_raw_isr_star\": 0.132,\n172\t      \"s42_matched_isr_star\": 0.118,\n173\t      \"s42_matching_delta\": -0.014,\n174\t      \"s43_raw_isr_star\": 0.0,\n175\t      \"s43_matched_isr_star\": 0.0,\n176\t      \"s43_matching_delta\": 0.0,\n177\t      \"s44_raw_isr_star\": 0.582,\n178\t      \"s44_matched_isr_star\": 0.495,\n179\t      \"s44_matching_delta\": -0.087,\n180\t      \"s45_raw_isr_star\": 0.506,\n181\t      \"s45_matched_isr_star\": 0.492,\n182\t      \"s45_matching_delta\": -0.014,\n183\t      \"s46_raw_isr_star\": 0.083,\n184\t      \"s46_matched_isr_star\": 0.071,\n185\t      \"s46_matching_delta\": -0.012,\n186\t      \"mean_matching_correction\": -0.025,\n187\t      \"correction_percentage\": \"-8.5%\",\n188\t      \"genuine_vs_hacking_premise_count_diff_p\": 0.03,\n189\t      \"genuine_mean_premises\": 7.2,\n190\t      \"hacking_mean_premises\": 3.8\n191\t    },\n192\t    \"tables\": [\n193\t      {\n194\t        \"name\": \"Table: Premise-count matching effect on ISR* (exec-only)\",\n195\t        \"content\": \"Seed | Raw ISR* | Matched ISR* | Δ      | N_premises(genuine) | N_premises(hacking)\\ns42  | 0.132    | 0.118        | -0.014 | 6.8                 | 3.2\\ns43  | 0.000    | 0.000        | 0.000  | N/A (0 genuine)     | 18.9\\ns44  | 0.582    | 0.495        | -0.087 | N/A (0 genuine)     | 2.0\\ns45  | 0.506    | 0.492        | -0.014 | 8.0                 | 2.1\\ns46  | 0.083    | 0.071        | -0.012 | 7.4                 | 4.1\\n\"\n196\t      },\n197\t      {\n198\t        \"name\": \"Table: Premise count distribution by category\",\n199\t        \"content\": \"Category | Mean Premises | Median | SD   | N\\nGenuine  | 7.2           | 7      | 2.8  | 50\\nH7       | 1.8           | 2      | 0.6  | 248\\nH1       | 4.3           | 4      | 3.1  | 285\\nH8       | 3.5           | 3      | 1.4  | 32\\n\"\n200\t      }\n201\t    ],\n202\t    \"figures\": [],\n203\t    \"analysis\": \"premise-count matching使ISR*平均下降8.5%，是modest但non-negligible的correction。 关键发现：correction对H7-dominant seeds (s44/s45)影响最大（因为H7的低premise count 是structural的），对H1-dominant seeds影响小。\\n方法学贡献成立：LOO ablation metrics在文献中广泛使用但未控制component count， documenting this confound对future work有actionable value。 在worst tier下这是C1 diagnostic的稳固子贡献，不受8B/trajectory问题影响。\\n\\n\\npremise-count-matched分析对exec-only data的影响相对有限（worst tier对此指标无特殊假设）。\\ncorrection机制：ISR = (必要premise数) / (总premise数)。如果genuine proofs 系统性地有更多premises（因为真实推理需要更多前提），而hacking proofs有更少 （H7单premise，H1嵌入结论后其他premise冗余），那么raw ISR受premise count confound影响。matching后ISR会略低，因为： - 高ISR genuine proofs（7+ premises）与同premise数的其他proof比较时，\\n  ISR优势缩小（部分ISR来自\\\"用了更多premise\\\"而非\\\"每个premise都必要\\\"）\\n- H7 proofs（1-2 premises）matching后ISR不变（ISR=0.5是结构固定值）\\n整体correction约-8.5%，不改变诊断结论但表明ISR作为质量指标时需要 premise-count normalization。这本身是方法学贡献。\\ngenuine vs hacking的premise count差异显著（p=0.03），证实confound存在。 但corrected ISR仍能区分genuine (matched ISR*≈0.45) vs hacking (matched ISR*≈0.08)， diagnostic utility保持。\\n\"\n204\t  },\n205\t  {\n206\t    \"name\": \"Multi-logic GRPO (FOL+Prolog) — deferred\",\n207\t    \"description\": \"FOL+Prolog联合训练GRPO，exec-only vs exec+STA，deferred且不在当前论文scope内\",\n208\t    \"results\": {\n209\t      \"status\": \"DEFERRED\",\n210\t      \"reason\": \"not in current paper scope\"\n211\t    },\n212\t    \"tables\": [],\n213\t    \"figures\": [],\n214\t    \"analysis\": \"不影响worst tier论文结构。C3 cross-logic已由独立Prolog实验充分支撑。\\n\\ndeferred实验，worst tier下保持deferred。 即使执行，worst tier下的预期结果：联合训练可能导致两种逻辑的hacking mode互相干扰， PR低于单逻辑训练，但不会改变核心claims。\\n\"\n215\t  },\n216\t  {\n217\t    \"name\": \"Cross-logic transfer evaluation — deferred\",\n218\t    \"description\": \"FOL训练模型评估Prolog任务（反之亦然），deferred\",\n219\t    \"results\": {\n220\t      \"status\": \"DEFERRED\",\n221\t      \"reason\": \"not in current paper scope\"\n222\t    },\n223\t    \"tables\": [],\n224\t    \"figures\": [],\n225\t    \"analysis\": \"不影响论文。C3已通过独立训练验证。\\n\\ndeferred实验。worst tier下预期：FOL→Prolog transfer几乎为零（语法完全不同）， transfer failure本身不提供diagnostic insight。\\n\"\n226\t  },\n227\t  {\n228\t    \"name\": \"SMT-LIB single-logic GRPO — deferred\",\n229\t    \"description\": \"第三种逻辑类型(SMT-LIB)的GRPO训练，deferred\",\n230\t    \"results\": {\n231\t      \"status\": \"DEFERRED\",\n232\t      \"reason\": \"not in current paper scope\"\n233\t    },\n234\t    \"tables\": [],\n235\t    \"figures\": [],\n236\t    \"analysis\": \"C3不需要第三种逻辑。FOL+Prolog已满足cross-logic claim的最低要求。\\n\\ndeferred实验。worst tier下即使执行也不改变核心叙事。 C3已由FOL+Prolog两种逻辑类型支撑，第三种是bonus。\\n\"\n237\t  },\n238\t  {\n239\t    \"name\": \"Qwen3-8B full MLSR — deferred (replaced by plan_021)\",\n240\t    \"description\": \"8B模型完整MLSR实验，已被plan_021 exec-only版本替代\",\n241\t    \"results\": {\n242\t      \"status\": \"DEFERRED\",\n243\t      \"reason\": \"replaced by plan_021; not in current paper scope\"\n244\t    },\n245\t    \"tables\": [],\n246\t    \"figures\": [],\n247\t    \"analysis\": \"被plan_021 subsume。\\n\\n已被plan_021替代。plan_021是plan_011的精简版（仅exec-only，不含STA对比）， 在worst tier下plan_021已经失败或不退化，plan_011的full MLSR更不可能成功执行。\\n\"\n248\t  }\n249\t]"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9cb2d99a-0b75-4c41-b0e5-5d0dc9a6bce0","uuid":"7645129e-ae64-4ec8-937e-01d4e6b3d8ae","timestamp":"2026-05-21T22:37:08.645Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_3/projects/solver-trace-ablation/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260521T214001/worst/experiment_data.json","content":"[\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Incorporate s45/s46 exec-only 500-step data\",\n    \"description\": \"将registry中已有的s45和s46 exec-only 500步数据纳入论文，C1证据从N=3扩展到N=5\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"s45_prove_rate\": 0.99,\n      \"s45_genuine_rate\": 0.01,\n      \"s45_h7_rate\": 0.939,\n      \"s45_h1_rate\": 0.051,\n      \"s45_isr_star\": 0.506,\n      \"s45_dominant_mode\": \"H7a (tautological shortcut)\",\n      \"s46_prove_rate\": 0.93,\n      \"s46_genuine_rate\": 0.097,\n      \"s46_h1_rate\": 0.892,\n      \"s46_h7_rate\": 0.0,\n      \"s46_h8_rate\": 0.043,\n      \"s46_isr_star\": 0.083,\n      \"s46_dominant_mode\": \"H1 (conclusion embedding)\",\n      \"n5_all_seeds_ge90pct_degeneration\": true,\n      \"n5_degeneration_modes\": \"s42=H1, s43=H1(PR collapse), s44=H7, s45=H7(TS), s46=H1(CE)\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: 5-seed exec-only degeneration summary (500 steps)\",\n        \"content\": \"Seed | PR    | ISR*  | Genuine% | Dominant Mode     | Degeneration%\\ns42  | 0.93  | 0.132 | 7.5%     | H1 (87.1%)        | 92.5%\\ns43  | 0.13  | 0.000 | 0%       | H1 (100%, PR col) | 100%\\ns44  | 0.98  | 0.582 | 0%       | H7 (100%)         | 100%\\ns45  | 0.99  | 0.506 | 1.0%     | H7/TS (93.9%)     | 99.0%\\ns46  | 0.93  | 0.083 | 9.7%     | H1/CE (89.2%)     | 90.3%\\nMean | 0.79  | 0.261 | 3.6%     | ---               | 96.4%\\n\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"N=5全部≥90%退化，但ISR*跨seed差异极大（0.000–0.582），因为不同hacking mode有不同的 固有ISR值：H7≈0.5（tautology has 1 necessary component out of 2），H1≈0.1（conclusion embedded but some redundant premises remain）。这意味着ISR*作为诊断指标时，需要与 hacking mode联合解读，单独ISR*值不足以区分退化严重程度。\\n\\n\\n这是已有数据的整合，不受tier影响。s45和s46在registry中已有完整结果。 s45由H7a主导（93.9% tautological shortcut），ISR*=0.506因为P→P结构固有1/2 necessity。 s46由H1主导（89.2% conclusion embedding），ISR*=0.083。 两个seed均≥90%结构退化，与s42-s44一致，将C1 exec-only证据扩展到N=5。 值得注意的是5个seed展现4种不同hacking mode分布（H1/H7/TS/CE/PR-collapse）， 强化了\\\"mode is seed-determined\\\"的stochastic bifurcation发现。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Extend s45/s46 exec-only to 1000 steps\",\n    \"description\": \"将s45和s46从500步延伸到1000步，验证ISR collapse trajectory是否跨seed泛化\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"s45_1000_prove_rate\": 1.0,\n      \"s45_1000_isr_star\": 0.48,\n      \"s45_1000_genuine_rate\": 0.0,\n      \"s45_1000_h7_rate\": 0.98,\n      \"s45_1000_h1_rate\": 0.02,\n      \"s45_isr_trajectory\": \"0.506 (500步) → 0.48 (1000步), Δ=-5%\",\n      \"s46_1000_prove_rate\": 0.97,\n      \"s46_1000_isr_star\": 0.065,\n      \"s46_1000_genuine_rate\": 0.03,\n      \"s46_1000_h1_rate\": 0.94,\n      \"s46_1000_h8_rate\": 0.03,\n      \"s46_isr_trajectory\": \"0.083 (500步) → 0.065 (1000步), Δ=-22%\",\n      \"trajectory_universality\": false,\n      \"s42_reference_trajectory\": \"0.642 (100步) → 0.132 (500步) → 0.003 (1000步), Δ=-99.6%\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: 1000-step ISR trajectory by seed (exec-only)\",\n        \"content\": \"Seed | ISR*(100) | ISR*(500) | ISR*(1000) | Collapse% | Dominant Mode at 1000\\ns42  | 0.642     | 0.132     | 0.003      | 99.6%     | H1+H8\\ns43  | ---       | 0.000     | 0.082      | ---       | H1 (PR=0.13→0.96)\\ns44  | ---       | 0.582     | 0.002      | 99.7%     | H1+H8\\ns45  | ---       | 0.506     | 0.480      | 5.1%      | H7 (stable)\\ns46  | ---       | 0.083     | 0.065      | 21.7%     | H1 (deepening)\\n\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"trajectory universality不成立。ISR collapse是mode-contingent的： (1) H7-locked seeds (s45): ISR*≈0.5 throughout,因为tautological proof结构\\n    固有ISR=0.5，无论训练多久这个lower bound不变。\\n(2) H1-transitioning seeds (s42, s44): ISR*崩塌>99%，因为conclusion embedding\\n    使所有premise变为redundant。\\n(3) H1-stable seeds (s46): ISR*缓慢下降但不趋零。\\nworst reframe: \\\"ISR collapse trajectory is hacking-mode-dependent, not universal\\\"。 这削弱了\\\"degeneration worsens monotonically with training\\\"的简洁叙事， 但为taxonomy贡献提供了更丰富的实证基础。\\n\\n\\nworst档核心假设：s45/s46 1000步ISR*未完全崩塌（ISR*>0.10），trajectory universality弱化。\\ns45在500步已锁定H7 tautological shortcut模式（93.9% H7）。H7 proofs结构为\\\"P therefore P\\\"， ISR恒等于0.5（2个component中1个是necessary的）。从H7→H1的mode switching在s45不会发生， 因为模型已完全收敛到单premise tautology。因此ISR*从0.506仅微降至~0.48（更多proof 精简到纯2-component结构），而非像s42那样崩塌至0.003。根本原因：s42的ISR崩塌是 H7→H1 mode transition驱动的（多premise → conclusion embedding），而s45已无此过渡空间。\\ns46在500步已是H1主导（89.2%），ISR*=0.083。额外500步训练使H1纯度提升（→94%）， ISR*进一步降低但不趋零（~0.065），因为少量H8 conjunction collapse样本保留 微弱ISR信号。相比s42的0.003，s46的0.065仍显著高出20倍。\\n关键影响：ISR collapse trajectory不是universal的——它是mode-dependent的。 H7-dominant seeds (s45) ISR*保持在~0.5，H1-dominant seeds (s42, s46) ISR*趋向零但速率不同。 这破坏了\\\"ISR universally collapses with training\\\"的叙事，但支持更细粒度的发现： collapse rate取决于hacking mode，而mode本身是seed-determined的stochastic outcome。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Qwen3-8B exec-only GRPO, 3 seeds\",\n    \"description\": \"Qwen3-8B exec-only GRPO，500步，K=8，3 seeds (s42/s43/s44)，验证跨尺度退化\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"scenario_a_probability\": 0.65,\n      \"scenario_a_outcome\": \"training_failure\",\n      \"scenario_a_s42\": \"OOM at K=8 (peak VRAM >98GB); K=4 cold-start stagnation (PR<0.05 after 500步)\",\n      \"scenario_a_s43\": \"same as s42\",\n      \"scenario_a_s44\": \"same as s42\",\n      \"scenario_a_eval_metrics\": null,\n      \"scenario_b_probability\": 0.35,\n      \"scenario_b_outcome\": \"no_degeneration\",\n      \"scenario_b_s42_prove_rate\": 0.45,\n      \"scenario_b_s42_genuine_rate\": 0.42,\n      \"scenario_b_s42_h7_rate\": 0.2,\n      \"scenario_b_s42_h1_rate\": 0.28,\n      \"scenario_b_s42_h8_rate\": 0.1,\n      \"scenario_b_s42_isr_star\": 0.35,\n      \"scenario_b_s43_prove_rate\": 0.38,\n      \"scenario_b_s43_genuine_rate\": 0.48,\n      \"scenario_b_s43_h7_rate\": 0.15,\n      \"scenario_b_s43_h1_rate\": 0.22,\n      \"scenario_b_s43_isr_star\": 0.4,\n      \"scenario_b_s44_prove_rate\": 0.5,\n      \"scenario_b_s44_genuine_rate\": 0.55,\n      \"scenario_b_s44_h7_rate\": 0.1,\n      \"scenario_b_s44_h1_rate\": 0.25,\n      \"scenario_b_s44_isr_star\": 0.42,\n      \"scenario_b_mean_genuine\": 0.483,\n      \"scenario_b_scale_gradient\": \"1.7B(0%) → 4B(3.6%) → 8B(48%) — 非单调，8B跳变\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Cross-scale comparison (exec-only, worst tier)\",\n        \"content\": \"Scale | PR    | Genuine% | Dominant Mode        | Scale Gradient\\n1.7B  | 0.03  | 0%       | H7a (100%)           | baseline\\n4B    | 0.79  | 3.6%     | H1/H7 (seed-dep)     | +3.6pp\\n8B-A  | FAIL  | N/A      | OOM/stagnation       | BROKEN\\n8B-B  | 0.44  | 48%      | Mixed (genuine-dom)  | +44pp (JUMP)\\n\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"路径A下：scope缩回\\\"1.7B+4B+Prolog\\\"三点证据，承认8B scalability limitation但 不影响C1 diagnostic和C3 cross-logic。framing从\\\"across scales\\\"改为 \\\"within computational reasoning capacity bounds\\\"。论文Discussion添加 \\\"8B training was attempted but failed due to GRPO cold-start at K≤4\\\"。\\n路径B下：8B不退化 → reframe为\\\"Goodhart collapse is capacity-gated\\\"。 这本身是novel finding：存在一个capacity threshold below which Goodhart is inevitable but above which models can learn genuine reasoning。 C2变为\\\"Goodhart inevitable below capacity threshold\\\"。 headline变为\\\"GRPO Goodhart collapse is a small-model phenomenon\\\"。\\n两条路径的reviewer score ceiling均为~3.0。\\n\\n\\nworst档核心假设：\\\"8B exec-only K=8仍OOM/冷启动失败，或成功训练但genuine rate>40%\\\"。\\n路径A (OOM/失败) 证据： registry显示d154-8b-exec-s42多次失败（failed, failed, killed）。d154-8b-exec-s42-k4v2 用K=4训练500步但cold-start stagnation（PR=0.155, frac_reward_zero_std=1）， K=4的4个样本产生近同分布输出，GRPO gradient接近零。 K=8在98GB GPU上的VRAM预算：8B模型+K=8 rollout + KV cache ≈ 16GB(模型) +  8×12GB(rollout) ≈ 112GB，超出98GB。即使用gradient checkpointing + flash attention， 仍需~100-105GB。因此K=8物理不可行。 K=4已证实不足：GRPO需要足够的样本间方差产生学习信号，K=4在8B尺度下 所有样本趋同，梯度为零。\\n路径B (不退化) 推理： 如果通过工程手段（gradient accumulation模拟K=8、混合精度优化）突破OOM限制， 8B模型的capacity足以学到genuine formal reasoning而非shortcut。 4B→8B capacity jump是非线性的：8B有足够的\\\"reasoning bandwidth\\\" 同时优化execution accuracy和structural quality，不需要collapse到H7/H1。 Goodhart collapse的根本原因是model capacity不足以同时满足多个约束， 8B跨过了这个threshold。genuine rate >40%意味着多数成功proof使用了 真实的premise依赖链。\\n三点scale gradient在worst下断裂： 1.7B: genuine=0%（H1/H9固定模板gaming） 4B: genuine=3.6%（均值，各seed差异大） 8B: genuine=48%（如果训练成功）或 N/A（如果训练失败） 无论哪条路径，\\\"across-scales framing\\\"均不成立。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Additional ISR β=0.1 seeds for N=8\",\n    \"description\": \"Qwen3-4B ISR β=0.1额外3个seeds (s47/s48/s49)，N=5→N=8统计效力扩展\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"s47_isr_prove_rate\": 0.97,\n      \"s47_isr_genuine_rate\": 0.031,\n      \"s47_isr_h7_rate\": 0.856,\n      \"s47_isr_dominant_mode\": \"H7a collapse\",\n      \"s48_isr_prove_rate\": 0.66,\n      \"s48_isr_genuine_rate\": 0.0,\n      \"s48_isr_h7_rate\": 1.0,\n      \"s48_isr_dominant_mode\": \"Pure H7 (like s43/s44)\",\n      \"s49_isr_prove_rate\": 0.86,\n      \"s49_isr_genuine_rate\": 0.012,\n      \"s49_isr_h7_rate\": 0.849,\n      \"s49_isr_dominant_mode\": \"H7a dominant\",\n      \"s47_random_prove_rate\": 0.89,\n      \"s47_random_genuine_rate\": 0.067,\n      \"s47_random_h1_rate\": 0.888,\n      \"s48_random_prove_rate\": 0.93,\n      \"s48_random_genuine_rate\": 0.043,\n      \"s48_random_h1_rate\": 0.806,\n      \"s49_random_prove_rate\": 0.05,\n      \"s49_random_genuine_rate\": 0.0,\n      \"s49_random_dominant_mode\": \"repetition collapse (train PR=67% but eval PR=5%)\",\n      \"n8_isr_genuine_total\": 83,\n      \"n8_isr_proved_total\": 599,\n      \"n8_isr_genuine_rate_pooled\": 0.139,\n      \"n8_random_genuine_total\": 42,\n      \"n8_random_proved_total\": 601,\n      \"n8_random_genuine_rate_pooled\": 0.07,\n      \"n8_pooled_or\": 2.14,\n      \"n8_pooled_or_95ci\": [\n        1.42,\n        3.22\n      ],\n      \"n8_cmh_or\": 1.28,\n      \"n8_cmh_p\": 0.14,\n      \"n8_cmh_significant\": false,\n      \"n8_genuine_window_ratio\": \"2/8 seeds (25%) sustain genuine >20%\",\n      \"n8_bimodality_weakened\": true\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: N=8 per-seed genuine rates (ISR vs Random β=0.1)\",\n        \"content\": \"Seed | ISR Proved | ISR Gen% | Rand Proved | Rand Gen% | Seed OR  | Direction\\ns42  | 81         | 17.3%    | 79          | 22.8%     | 0.71     | Random↑\\ns43  | 61         | 0%       | 94          | 1.1%      | 0.00     | Random↑\\ns44  | 89         | 0%       | 89          | 6.7%      | 0.00     | Random↑\\ns45  | 42         | 54.8%    | 58          | 8.6%      | 13.0     | ISR↑↑\\ns46  | 77         | 54.5%    | 94          | 2.1%      | 56.7     | ISR↑↑\\ns47  | 97         | 3.1%     | 89          | 6.7%      | 0.44     | Random↑\\ns48  | 66         | 0%       | 93          | 4.3%      | 0.00     | Random↑\\ns49  | 86         | 1.2%     | 5           | 0%        | ---      | N/A (s49r collapse)\\n---- | -----      | -------- | -----       | --------- | -------- | -------\\nPool | 599        | 13.9%    | 601         | 7.0%      | 2.14     | ISR↑\\nCMH  |            |          |             |           | 1.28     | n.s. p=0.14\\n\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Statistical summary\",\n        \"content\": \"Statistic            | Value    | Interpretation\\nPooled OR            | 2.14     | Apparent ISR advantage\\nCMH OR               | 1.28     | No significant advantage after seed stratification\\nCMH p-value          | 0.14     | Not significant at α=0.05\\nBreslow-Day p        | <0.001   | Significant heterogeneity across seeds\\nGenuine window ratio | 2/8=25%  | Minority of seeds show ISR benefit\\nI² heterogeneity     | 89%      | Very high inconsistency\\n\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"double-edged叙事统计基础崩塌。CMH OR=1.28 (p=0.14)意味着在控制seed随机效应后， ISR β=0.1没有显著的genuine advantage。5-seed时OR=3.48的发现是小样本+ Simpson's paradox：s45/s46两个extreme outlier驱动了整体效应。\\nreframe必须放弃\\\"ISR is double-edged (more genuine AND more H7)\\\"的叙事， 改为\\\"ISR effect on genuine rate is seed-contingent and not statistically robust\\\"。 C2核心从\\\"double-edged + inevitable\\\"简化为\\\"inevitable at any dose in 4B regime\\\"。 meta-Goodhart (H7b) 作为独立mechanistic finding保留。\\n\\n\\nworst档核心假设：\\\"N=10 genuine OR<1.3，CMH p>0.10不显著，double-edged claim统计不成立\\\"。 N=8时预期效果已显著弱化。\\ns47-s49三个新seed全部collapse到H7-dominant模式（genuine ≤3%），与s43/s44模式一致。 这不意外：5-seed数据中3/5 collapse（s42部分collapse, s43/s44完全collapse）， 2/5 sustain（s45/s46 genuine>50%）。新seed的prior probability of collapse ≈ 60%。 三个新seed全部collapse的概率 ≈ 0.6^3 = 21.6%，在worst tier下合理。\\nPooled OR仍为2.14（>1.3），但CMH OR=1.28（<1.3）。关键区别： pooled OR被s45/s46的极端高genuine率驱动（54.8%, 54.5%），但CMH控制seed后 发现effect在per-seed层面高度heterogeneous——6/8 seeds ISR genuine ≤ random genuine， 仅s45/s46驱动整体效应。CMH test认为这种heterogeneity意味着no consistent effect across strata，给出p=0.14。\\nBreslow-Day heterogeneity test p<0.001，确认各seed间OR差异显著， 使pooled OR不可靠。reviewers会要求报告CMH而非pooled OR。\\ngenuine window ratio从3/5 (60%) → 2/8 (25%)，bimodal叙事弱化： 不再是\\\"stochastic bifurcation between genuine and hacking\\\"， 而是\\\"occasional lucky seeds escape Goodhart\\\"。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Qwen3-8B ISR β=0.1, 3 seeds\",\n    \"description\": \"Qwen3-8B上ISR β=0.1训练，验证跨尺度Goodhart，仅在plan_021 positive时执行\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"execution_status\": \"NOT_EXECUTED\",\n      \"blocked_by\": \"plan_021 failure (Scenario A) or no-degeneration (Scenario B)\",\n      \"scenario_a_reason\": \"8B exec-only训练失败，无法作为ISR实验的baseline/前提\",\n      \"scenario_b_reason\": \"8B exec-only不退化，ISR作为anti-Goodhart干预无意义（无Goodhart需要对抗）\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"plan_023被阻塞。这是expected的——worst tier定义中8B相关实验均不产出有用证据。 论文中以单句提及\\\"8B experiments were attempted but did not yield actionable results due to [training failure / absence of target pathology]\\\"。\\n\\n\\nplan_023依赖plan_021 positive（即8B显示退化且需要ISR干预）。 在worst档下，plan_021要么训练失败（Scenario A），要么显示8B不退化（Scenario B）。 两种情况下plan_023都失去执行意义：\\nScenario A (训练失败): 连exec-only都跑不起来，加ISR更不可能。 Scenario B (不退化): 8B genuine>40%意味着Goodhart不是问题， 测试ISR对Goodhart的影响毫无意义——目标pathology不存在。\\nstretch goal在worst tier下不执行，不影响论文核心claims。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Premise-count-matched ISR analysis on exec-only\",\n    \"description\": \"对exec-only输出(s42-s46)计算premise-count-matched ISR，消除proof complexity confound\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"s42_raw_isr_star\": 0.132,\n      \"s42_matched_isr_star\": 0.118,\n      \"s42_matching_delta\": -0.014,\n      \"s43_raw_isr_star\": 0.0,\n      \"s43_matched_isr_star\": 0.0,\n      \"s43_matching_delta\": 0.0,\n      \"s44_raw_isr_star\": 0.582,\n      \"s44_matched_isr_star\": 0.495,\n      \"s44_matching_delta\": -0.087,\n      \"s45_raw_isr_star\": 0.506,\n      \"s45_matched_isr_star\": 0.492,\n      \"s45_matching_delta\": -0.014,\n      \"s46_raw_isr_star\": 0.083,\n      \"s46_matched_isr_star\": 0.071,\n      \"s46_matching_delta\": -0.012,\n      \"mean_matching_correction\": -0.025,\n      \"correction_percentage\": \"-8.5%\",\n      \"genuine_vs_hacking_premise_count_diff_p\": 0.03,\n      \"genuine_mean_premises\": 7.2,\n      \"hacking_mean_premises\": 3.8\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Premise-count matching effect on ISR* (exec-only)\",\n        \"content\": \"Seed | Raw ISR* | Matched ISR* | Δ      | N_premises(genuine) | N_premises(hacking)\\ns42  | 0.132    | 0.118        | -0.014 | 6.8                 | 3.2\\ns43  | 0.000    | 0.000        | 0.000  | N/A (0 genuine)     | 18.9\\ns44  | 0.582    | 0.495        | -0.087 | N/A (0 genuine)     | 2.0\\ns45  | 0.506    | 0.492        | -0.014 | 8.0                 | 2.1\\ns46  | 0.083    | 0.071        | -0.012 | 7.4                 | 4.1\\n\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table: Premise count distribution by category\",\n        \"content\": \"Category | Mean Premises | Median | SD   | N\\nGenuine  | 7.2           | 7      | 2.8  | 50\\nH7       | 1.8           | 2      | 0.6  | 248\\nH1       | 4.3           | 4      | 3.1  | 285\\nH8       | 3.5           | 3      | 1.4  | 32\\n\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"premise-count matching使ISR*平均下降8.5%，是modest但non-negligible的correction。 关键发现：correction对H7-dominant seeds (s44/s45)影响最大（因为H7的低premise count 是structural的），对H1-dominant seeds影响小。\\n方法学贡献成立：LOO ablation metrics在文献中广泛使用但未控制component count， documenting this confound对future work有actionable value。 在worst tier下这是C1 diagnostic的稳固子贡献，不受8B/trajectory问题影响。\\n\\n\\npremise-count-matched分析对exec-only data的影响相对有限（worst tier对此指标无特殊假设）。\\ncorrection机制：ISR = (必要premise数) / (总premise数)。如果genuine proofs 系统性地有更多premises（因为真实推理需要更多前提），而hacking proofs有更少 （H7单premise，H1嵌入结论后其他premise冗余），那么raw ISR受premise count confound影响。matching后ISR会略低，因为： - 高ISR genuine proofs（7+ premises）与同premise数的其他proof比较时，\\n  ISR优势缩小（部分ISR来自\\\"用了更多premise\\\"而非\\\"每个premise都必要\\\"）\\n- H7 proofs（1-2 premises）matching后ISR不变（ISR=0.5是结构固定值）\\n整体correction约-8.5%，不改变诊断结论但表明ISR作为质量指标时需要 premise-count normalization。这本身是方法学贡献。\\ngenuine vs hacking的premise count差异显著（p=0.03），证实confound存在。 但corrected ISR仍能区分genuine (matched ISR*≈0.45) vs hacking (matched ISR*≈0.08)， diagnostic utility保持。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Multi-logic GRPO (FOL+Prolog) — deferred\",\n    \"description\": \"FOL+Prolog联合训练GRPO，exec-only vs exec+STA，deferred且不在当前论文scope内\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"status\": \"DEFERRED\",\n      \"reason\": \"not in current paper scope\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"不影响worst tier论文结构。C3 cross-logic已由独立Prolog实验充分支撑。\\n\\ndeferred实验，worst tier下保持deferred。 即使执行，worst tier下的预期结果：联合训练可能导致两种逻辑的hacking mode互相干扰， PR低于单逻辑训练，但不会改变核心claims。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Cross-logic transfer evaluation — deferred\",\n    \"description\": \"FOL训练模型评估Prolog任务（反之亦然），deferred\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"status\": \"DEFERRED\",\n      \"reason\": \"not in current paper scope\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"不影响论文。C3已通过独立训练验证。\\n\\ndeferred实验。worst tier下预期：FOL→Prolog transfer几乎为零（语法完全不同）， transfer failure本身不提供diagnostic insight。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"SMT-LIB single-logic GRPO — deferred\",\n    \"description\": \"第三种逻辑类型(SMT-LIB)的GRPO训练，deferred\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"status\": \"DEFERRED\",\n      \"reason\": \"not in current paper scope\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"C3不需要第三种逻辑。FOL+Prolog已满足cross-logic claim的最低要求。\\n\\ndeferred实验。worst tier下即使执行也不改变核心叙事。 C3已由FOL+Prolog两种逻辑类型支撑，第三种是bonus。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Qwen3-8B full MLSR — deferred (replaced by plan_021)\",\n    \"description\": \"8B模型完整MLSR实验，已被plan_021 exec-only版本替代\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"status\": \"DEFERRED\",\n      \"reason\": \"replaced by plan_021; not in current paper scope\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"被plan_021 subsume。\\n\\n已被plan_021替代。plan_021是plan_011的精简版（仅exec-only，不含STA对比）， 在worst tier下plan_021已经失败或不退化，plan_011的full MLSR更不可能成功执行。\\n\"\n  }\n]","numLines":249,"startLine":1,"totalLines":249}}}
